"- Review the [`QiskitRuntimeService` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service) for additional job management methods.\n"
"- Explore [execution modes](/guides/execution-modes) to understand batch and session workload types.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Empfehlungen\">\n"
"- Sieh dir die [`QiskitRuntimeService`-API-Referenz](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service) für weitere Methoden zur Job-Verwaltung an.\n"
"- Erkunde die [Ausführungsmodi](/guides/execution-modes), um Batch- und Session-Workload-Typen zu verstehen.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
